-- J5 significant change (s.2(4)), J6 commercially and technically reasonable (s.2(1))
`WA judgements F F` MEANS
    `Washington section 2 judgements` WITH
        `the alteration is a significant change that substantially alters the data in content` IS FALSE
        `including provenance data is commercially and technically reasonable` IS FALSE

