-- J7 technically feasible, J8 permanent or extraordinarily difficult to remove; tool compatibility TRUE (B0 fact 14)
`CA inputs F T` MEANS
    `California 22757.3 inputs` WITH
        `including a latent disclosure is technically feasible` IS FALSE
        `the disclosure is permanent or extraordinarily difficult to remove or tamper with` IS TRUE
        `the disclosure is compatible with the covered provider's disclosure verification tool` IS TRUE

-- J7 technically feasible, J8 permanent or extraordinarily difficult to remove; tool compatibility TRUE (B0 fact 14)
`CA inputs T F` MEANS
    `California 22757.3 inputs` WITH
        `including a latent disclosure is technically feasible` IS TRUE
        `the disclosure is permanent or extraordinarily difficult to remove or tamper with` IS FALSE
        `the disclosure is compatible with the covered provider's disclosure verification tool` IS TRUE

